{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/317902-digital-nightmares","id":317902,"title":"Digital Nightmares","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-20T20:50:36-08:00","id":317902,"title":"Digital Nightmares","content":"As reading lately <b>Autumn Nightmares</b> chapter about Others, I got idea. From the book we know that Gentry can creat things, that's way they can't have high Computers and Crafts ( also, Expression ). But because there are Fae that are like mechanical monsters in the shape of cars (!!!) or many myths of singers and creators being stolen to work for them - what about one, &quot;very new&quot; ( <b>maybe</b> 30-40 years old ), Stranger who is obsessed with computers and Internet?<br /> <br /> I was thinking maybe about giant, glass and metal spider sitting in cable maze of wires and information. Oh, wait, here it is ( and punny technician fightin it for it's freedom). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://youtu.be/isDHt7VMFto\" data-code=\"isDHt7VMFto\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/isDHt7VMFto/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Of course, the Fae don't really get technology, but has a horde of his changeling that make sure everything works best. And it wants to make an Internet in Arcadia. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T21:17:00-08:00","id":317934,"title":"","content":"I don't know if it would be fair to say that the Gentry don't &quot;get&quot; technology, just that their artifice doesn't operate by the same rules as the mortal technology it might superficially resemble. I think would be pretty straightforward to have a Fae realm with a science or technology bent, just one in which everything is warped and exaggerated by the weird conceptual basis of Arcadia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T04:11:53-08:00","id":318155,"title":"","content":"Actuelly, it could do an awesome prelude for changeling character, Matrix like <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Somewhere on the net lie a website where some very weirds things can be found : articles about events who never occured, about musical stars long dead, ... it's just a mythomaniac who whrote all this, surely, but when you post on his forum odd things begin to happen to you. More spam about impossible products, more pop-ups about strange people trying to speak whith you... And one day you click on the wrong banner, and things go up. You find yourself sleepwalking on your computer , and one day the dream won't stop until the thing beyond the screen come out to catch you.<br /> <br /> Sure, technology in the hedge/Arcadia won't work, but the idea of technology can spread <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3883-arabidopsis","name":"Arabidopsis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T22:27:41-08:00","id":318723,"title":"","content":"I think the limitation on Gentry's Crafts and Computers is that they can't really create anything *new,* only repeat, corrupt, emulate, and parody things which they've seen. If that's the case, then eventually the computer will be established enough for one of the Others to corrupt, emulate, and parody. Perhaps one of your characters was the first of such a Keeper's captives?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T01:24:00-08:00","id":318796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/317902-digital-nightmares?p=318723#post318723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the limitation on Gentry's Crafts and Computers is that they can't really create anything *new,* only repeat, corrupt, emulate, and parody things which they've seen. If that's the case, then eventually the computer will be established enough for one of the Others to corrupt, emulate, and parody. Perhaps one of your characters was the first of such a Keeper's captives?</div> </div> </div> </div>Or Keeper used character to &quot;make Internetz&quot; for her in Arcadia. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T03:28:45-08:00","id":318835,"title":"","content":"am I the only one who immediately thought about Slenderman?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T06:21:05-08:00","id":318910,"title":"","content":"The Slender Man is the perfect image of a Keeper who possibly stole its face from an idea that originated on the internet (if he isn't a tulpa or a spirit or...).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T06:33:37-08:00","id":318915,"title":"","content":"Other idea - what would be Kith for Arcadian &quot;kachers&quot;, changelings stolen to make a computers in Faerie? Probably they would be from Wizined, as they Keeper would force them to put all those cables... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T08:51:12-08:00","id":318979,"title":"","content":"They are obviously Wizened of the Artist and Hacker Kiths.<br /> <br /> <b>Hacker:</b> Almost unknown before the 1980s, this Kith consists almost entirely of Changelings that were forced to work with computers (or, at least, the Arcadian equivalent) as part of their Durance. The Hacker's blessing is Ghost In The Machine - they enjoy the 9-Again quality on all Computers rolls. At Wyrd 7, they instead benefit from the 8-Again quality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T09:25:05-08:00","id":318997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think the limitation on Gentry's Crafts and Computers is that they can't really create anything *new,* only repeat, corrupt, emulate, and parody things which they've seen. If that's the case, then eventually the computer will be established enough for one of the Others to corrupt, emulate, and parody. Perhaps one of your characters was the first of such a Keeper's captives? </div> </div> </div>I actually imagine a Faerie Domain turned into a Metropolis inspired on Cyberpunk 2020 rpg.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 11-22-2014, 04:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T10:21:37-08:00","id":319046,"title":"","content":"<b>Inventor</b><br /> <br /> Human dreams of laboratories, machinery, electronics, and devices plague the Fae, who have difficulty understanding a world where the rules were not actively invented by another, and sometimes they snatch up what humans they can and set them to work building and creating marvelous devices. Inventors acquire <b>Mechanical Genius</b>, granting them the 8-again rule on all Crafts and Science rolls involving mechanisms and devices. In addition, they may spend a point of Glamour to add their Wyrd score as a bonus to such rolls.<br /> <br /> <b>Machine Ghost</b><br /> <br /> Systems engineers, code monkeys, and masters of electronics, Machine Ghosts were trapped in strange worlds and forced to serve as operating systems, power supplies, or living processors for their True Fae masters. Now back in the mortal world, Machine Ghosts can <b>Jack In</b>, allowing them to spend a point of Glamour to gain the 9-Again quality on their Computers and Academics rolls.<br /> ____________________<br /> <br /> <b>The Grid</b><br /> Accessible through flickering, hissing passages in the Hedge hidden behind rusted up machinery or dark holes among seeping oil, the Grid is a nest of wires and neon lights, covered in fragmented static and bundled up in hard plastic. Goblin fruits take the form of capacitors, packets of nonsensical data, or \u201chealth packs,\u201d and paths take the form of printed circuits. It's a relatively unique feature of the Hedge in Atomic City, and there are several theories as to why it even exists in the first place. Most of those, however, assume much about the nature of the Hedge itself. Otherwise, most hobs avoid it, except those native to it, who rarely venture out, if at all. Hobs native to the area tend to be much like it: grim, mechanical, and tastefully decorated in electricity, neon, and gold or copper. Most Changelings don't even want to know what might happen if you try to get to Arcadia from the Grid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T10:36:16-08:00","id":319061,"title":"","content":"I'm assuming Inventors are Wizened, and Machine Ghosts are Elementals?<br /> <br /> The Grid is pretty boss, by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T17:45:26-08:00","id":319513,"title":"","content":"Didn't that one book, Victoria Lost, have a Inventor Kith?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T21:53:25-08:00","id":319605,"title":"","content":"You are correct, I think it even had the same stats, like, I think that's where I got it, and I just copied it into my document.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}